    <div><p class="eyebrow">Make ideas inspectable</p><h2 id="design-title">Design the path through complexity</h2></div>
    <div class="prose"><p>Good design helps people form an accurate mental model of the system. It makes available actions, status, dependencies, and consequences visible.</p><p>Start with the smallest representation that helps the team learn: a content outline, workflow, sketch, or prototype may be enough.</p></div>
