  <article class="content-card"><p class="card-number">01</p><h3>Structure</h3><p>Organize content, navigation, and workflows around user goals and meaningful system concepts.</p></article>
  <article class="content-card"><p class="card-number">02</p><h3>Prototype</h3><p>Choose a level of fidelity that answers the question without overinvesting in an untested direction.</p></article>
